Method:
The script asks the fresh K parser for constructor-level JSON for the submitted
solution.mpy. It extracts the theorem's `closureVal` arguments from
verification.k, checks parameter `s` and defining scope 0, converts only the
explicit empty list tails (`.Exprs`, `.Stmts`) to equivalent MPY surface-list
syntax, asks the same K parser for constructor JSON, and requires exact JSON
tree equality. No typing import or program operation was omitted.

